   grain_volumes grains i icomp iele ifield igrain inertiavalues inp inpold inverse_rmatrix ...
   iphase iqpt isolver isolvers j1 jnp kc kmatrix   lenxyz loadcode loadcodes m maxcomp maxss maxvalue me ...
   message message1 message2 message3 message4 message5 message6 minxyz myrot myrot  ...
   nepermshname neperversionnumber nepermshname minzyz myrot mesh newcoords newnp n neutralaxisvalues newnpinv ...
   newnumnp ngrains nnpe nomdisplacement nominalstrain nomstress np nphases npsigma nqptv numel numelepernp ...
   numeq numfields numnp old2new orientations phase_schmid_tensors phasenum phaseofgrain phases phi ...
   r_matrix r_matrix_all re2sx re2sx re2sx_ave rotated_rmatrix rotations rss rse rse_ave sample_volume schmid_tensor ...
   relrss relrss_ave schmid_tensors schmidfactor schmidfactors schmidfactors_ave se sfac shafac_structure shafac_surf_structure sigma sigelnp ...
   sigma_average sigma_ave sigmanp sigmanpave sigmaxnp sigmaxs sigminnp sigmins sigrangenp sigrangenpmax ...
